 "description": "<p>This dataset includes all of the voting places available to voters for the 2025 general election. The City of Vancouver uses a Vote-Anywhere model.​​ Since 2014, voters can vote at any voting place within the City.​​</p><p>​The City operates an at-large ​​voting system.​​</p><p>​​​​Advance voting days: March 26 and April 1, 2025</p><p>​​Election day: April 5, 2025</p><p>​​​​​​​Voting hours for all locations are 8am to 8pm.</p><p><br></p><h3 class=\"\">Note</h3><p>Residents of UBC and the University Endowment Lands were not eligible to vote in this by-election as there was no School Trustee contest.</p><p><br></p><p></p><h3>Data currency</h3><p>​​These are the voting places used for the ​City's 2025 local by-election during advance voting and on general voting day.​​</p><p><br></p><h3 class=\"\">Websites for further information</h3><p><a href=\"https://vancouver.ca/your-government/2025-by-election.aspx\" target=\"_blank\">Municipal elections​</a></p>",
